        <p class="subtitle">Demonstration chart layout for pH, turbidity, and chlorophyll-a tracking</p>
        <div class="specs-table-wrapper" style="padding:2rem;">
          <div style="position:relative; height:320px; width:100%;">
            <canvas id="readingsChart"></canvas>
          </div>
          <p style="text-align:center; font-size:0.85rem; color:#38bdf8; margin-top:1.2rem; font-weight:600;">
            ⚠️ Sample data for demonstration only — live sensor feeds populate automatically upon field deployment.
          </p>
